# Location brief — the designer's first artifact, written before Unreal opens.
# Verbatim from the world-development philosophy §1790, so the tool's own example
# is the doc's example. Run:
#
#   python Scripts/location_brief.py --brief Documentation/World/Briefs/FinancialCanyon.brief
#
# A key is a line ending in ':'. Values are the lines under it, one per line.
# Names are designer language — the tool resolves them to RowNames and says so.

